Port Repository: https://github.com/leonlowery507-png/dsh-obsidian-prism
Date of Modification: 2026-11-22
Upstream Baseline: RMvdesi/obsidian-prism v1.0.7-beta.1
                   (commit 5dac53bfa7cf917d40101dad2579f32dd1b1b587,
                   https://github.com/RMvdesi/obsidian-prism)
Summary of Modifications:
  - Mapped Obsidian Prism's 4 optical palettes (obsidian, warm, crystal,
    alabaster) and 5 industrial accent presets to DeepSeek Harness
    (`--dsw-static-*`, `--dsw-alias-*`, `body` inline variables) and
    `--ag-prism-*` tokens without moving or wrapping React children.
  - Replaced Antigravity desktop CDP sidecar RPC bindings with a pure-browser
    runtime bridge (`src/dsh-bridge.js`) and non-blocking Cordis host plugin
    (`lib/index.js` & `src/index.mjs`) for DeepSeek Harness Desktop & Web.
  - Adapted real DSH Composer, sidebar, model/effort menu (with back button and
    continuous damped starfield slider), permission surfaces, Smoked Obsidian
    facets, borderless assistant markdown replies, and native `settings.section`
    two-column preferences (`33` upstream + `3` DSH settings).
  - Replaced Antigravity 5h/weekly quota pools with live DSH model/context
    projection and API usage billing; added clean-room DeepSeek blue-whale and
    orca parent-child pixel companions (`src/deepseek-companions.js`), Home
    Studio real-data dashboard + 0fps horizon ripple, and 21 micro-animated
    native icons (`src/prism-native-icons.js`).
  - Intentionally excluded Antigravity-specific or out-of-scope features:
    Inline Diff, `/btw` selection actions, Chat Beta, Sidebar Studio, Omni
    viewer/sidecars, host i18n localization, and 5h/weekly quota telemetry.
  - Preserved GPL-3.0-only licensing, full upstream attribution to RMvdesi,
    and all third-party notices (`NOTICE` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`).
  - This community port is NOT an official release by RMvdesi, DeepSeek, or
    Google LLC.
